        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-time-p07-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "将 + predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "将 before a verb marks an anticipated future event, especially in formal announcements. Distinguish it from object-marking 将.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "会议将开始。",
                "pinyin": "huìyì jiāng kāishǐ 。",
                "meaning": "The meeting will begin.",
                "audio": "9e5dba6b1735e6921309be79a265c5540423d37d27045eee3ec2eefc022900f9"
              },
              {
                "text": "我们将去北京。",
                "pinyin": "wǒmen jiāng qù Běijīng 。",
                "meaning": "We will go to Beijing.",
                "audio": "c9ceb9e856711dc4629af0491d89ee5fe007d2e4ae9e60168dd781231e830c06"
              }
            ]
          },
